Package: xdg-desktop-portal-gds
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xdg-desktop-portal
Suggests: gds-files
Description: GDS desktop portal backend
 Provides the desktop FileChooser interface using GDS Files.
 Install GDS Files separately for the native picker. Installing this
 package does not change desktop portal routing or default applications.
